  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam Airport Management Training Program, through American Association of Airport Executives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA-funded Vietnam Airport Management Training Program Reverse Trade Mission will support one training session in Vietnam and another training session in the United States for up to 15 Vietnamese airport managers and aviation officials. The training program will focus on providing technical, managerial and operational training to support airport development and aviation safety in Vietnam. The training program will be provided in coordination with the U.S. Federal Aviation Administration and the U.S.-Southeast Asia Aviation Cooperation Program. This funding is being added to the Vietnam Airport Management Training Program.</narrative>
  </description>
